Here's a comprehensive guide on how to integrate your Teachable Machine model into a React frontend:

## 1. Export Your Model from Teachable Machine

First, export your model from Teachable Machine:
- Click "Export Model" in the top right
- Choose "Tensorflow.js" tab
- Select "Upload my model to a cloud" or "Download my model"
- Copy the model URL or download the files

## 2. Install Required Dependencies

```bash
npm install @tensorflow/tfjs
npm install @tensorflow-models/knn-classifier
```

